# {{appNameBase}} SDK - AI Agent Reference

## Installation

```bash
dotnet add package {{packageName}}
```

## Quick Start

```csharp
using {{packageName}};
using {{packageName}}.Auth;

var client = global::{{packageName}}.{{clientClassName}}.WithToken("https://api.example.com", "your-token");
```

## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `IAuthenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```csharp
using {{packageName}}.Auth;

var authenticator = new BearerAuthenticator("https://api.example.com", "your-token");
var client = new global::{{packageName}}.{{clientClassName}}(authenticator);
```

{{#hasBasicAuth}}
### Basic Auth

```csharp
using {{packageName}}.Auth;

var authenticator = new BasicAuthenticator("https://api.example.com", "username", "password");
var client = new global::{{packageName}}.{{clientClassName}}(authenticator);
```

{{/hasBasicAuth}}
